      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; color: #0369a1; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        3. Content (Rich Text — Copy &amp; Paste Directly into Blog Editor)
      </h2>
      <div class="blog-rich-content" style="border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 18px; background-color: #ffffff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #0f172a;">
        <p>Hello&nbsp;friend.&nbsp;So,&nbsp;you&nbsp;just&nbsp;finished&nbsp;the&nbsp;12th&nbsp;with&nbsp;commerce,&nbsp;right?&nbsp;And&nbsp;now&nbsp;you&nbsp;keep&nbsp;hearing&nbsp;words&nbsp;like&nbsp;“data,”&nbsp;“AI,”&nbsp;and&nbsp;“data&nbsp;science”&nbsp;everywhere.&nbsp;You&nbsp;see&nbsp;people&nbsp;earning&nbsp;big&nbsp;money&nbsp;by&nbsp;just&nbsp;analyzing&nbsp;numbers&nbsp;and&nbsp;wonder,&nbsp;<em>“Can&nbsp;I&nbsp;also&nbsp;do&nbsp;that?&nbsp;I’m&nbsp;from&nbsp;commerce,&nbsp;not&nbsp;science!”</em></p><p>Well,&nbsp;here’s&nbsp;the&nbsp;good&nbsp;news&nbsp;—&nbsp;<strong>yes,&nbsp;you&nbsp;absolutely&nbsp;can!</strong>&nbsp;Even&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;don’t&nbsp;have&nbsp;a&nbsp;science&nbsp;background,&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;still&nbsp;learn&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;and&nbsp;build&nbsp;a&nbsp;career&nbsp;in&nbsp;it.&nbsp;It’s&nbsp;all&nbsp;about&nbsp;the&nbsp;friendly&nbsp;guide.&nbsp;Here,&nbsp;in&nbsp;this&nbsp;one,&nbsp;we&nbsp;will&nbsp;take&nbsp;you&nbsp;through&nbsp;all&nbsp;the&nbsp;steps&nbsp;of&nbsp;how&nbsp;to&nbsp;start&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;commerce.</p><h2><strong>What&nbsp;Exactly&nbsp;Is&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science?</strong></h2><p>Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;is&nbsp;all&nbsp;about&nbsp;information&nbsp;collection,&nbsp;analysis,&nbsp;and&nbsp;application&nbsp;for&nbsp;making&nbsp;wise&nbsp;decisions.&nbsp;Let’s&nbsp;keep&nbsp;it&nbsp;very&nbsp;basic.</p><ul><li>Imagine&nbsp;that&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;the&nbsp;proprietor&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;little&nbsp;shop.&nbsp;Every&nbsp;day,&nbsp;you&nbsp;write&nbsp;down&nbsp;the&nbsp;number&nbsp;of&nbsp;items&nbsp;sold,&nbsp;in&nbsp;addition&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;revenue&nbsp;made.&nbsp;Then,&nbsp;you&nbsp;check&nbsp;the&nbsp;figures&nbsp;to&nbsp;find&nbsp;out&nbsp;which&nbsp;product&nbsp;sold&nbsp;the&nbsp;most&nbsp;or&nbsp;which&nbsp;day&nbsp;had&nbsp;the&nbsp;most&nbsp;visitors.&nbsp;That’s&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;—&nbsp;just&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;smaller&nbsp;way.</li><li>Now,&nbsp;think&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;big&nbsp;players&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;Amazon&nbsp;or&nbsp;Netflix.&nbsp;They&nbsp;process&nbsp;enormous&nbsp;data&nbsp;to&nbsp;discover&nbsp;the&nbsp;users’&nbsp;preferences,&nbsp;shopping&nbsp;behavior,&nbsp;and&nbsp;even&nbsp;the&nbsp;next-best-suggestion.&nbsp;That’s&nbsp;a&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;application&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;background—facilitating&nbsp;businesses&nbsp;to&nbsp;expand,&nbsp;strategize,&nbsp;and&nbsp;foresee&nbsp;the&nbsp;future.</li></ul><h2><strong>Can&nbsp;a&nbsp;Commerce&nbsp;Student&nbsp;Do&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science?</strong></h2><p>You&nbsp;could&nbsp;be&nbsp;saying&nbsp;to&nbsp;yourself,&nbsp;&quot;Nevertheless,&nbsp;I&nbsp;did&nbsp;not&nbsp;take&nbsp;up&nbsp;Physics&nbsp;nor&nbsp;computer&nbsp;science.&quot;&nbsp;Do&nbsp;not&nbsp;be&nbsp;alarmed—it&nbsp;is&nbsp;completely&nbsp;okay!&nbsp;</p><p>If&nbsp;you&nbsp;have&nbsp;gone&nbsp;through&nbsp;the&nbsp;subjects&nbsp;of&nbsp;Maths,&nbsp;Statistics,&nbsp;or&nbsp;even&nbsp;Accountancy,&nbsp;you&nbsp;possess&nbsp;the&nbsp;basic&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;of&nbsp;numbers&nbsp;and&nbsp;logic&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;way&nbsp;that&nbsp;is&nbsp;already&nbsp;your&nbsp;arm.&nbsp;And&nbsp;guess&nbsp;what?&nbsp;That’s&nbsp;a&nbsp;huge&nbsp;part&nbsp;of&nbsp;data&nbsp;science.</p><p>So&nbsp;yes,&nbsp;<strong>a&nbsp;commerce&nbsp;student&nbsp;can&nbsp;do&nbsp;data&nbsp;science</strong>&nbsp;easily&nbsp;—&nbsp;you&nbsp;just&nbsp;need&nbsp;curiosity,&nbsp;patience,&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;little&nbsp;practice.&nbsp;<a href="https://snifferip.com/2W1nq.html" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">business&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;course&nbsp;</a></p><h2><strong>Who&nbsp;Is&nbsp;Eligible&nbsp;for&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;After&nbsp;12th&nbsp;Commerce?</strong></h2><p>There’s&nbsp;no&nbsp;strict&nbsp;rule&nbsp;that&nbsp;says&nbsp;only&nbsp;science&nbsp;students&nbsp;can&nbsp;study&nbsp;data&nbsp;science.&nbsp;The&nbsp;truth&nbsp;is,&nbsp;<strong>anyone&nbsp;who&nbsp;has&nbsp;completed&nbsp;their&nbsp;12th&nbsp;(from&nbsp;any&nbsp;stream)</strong>&nbsp;is&nbsp;eligible.</p><p>You&nbsp;just&nbsp;need:</p><ul><li>You&nbsp;need&nbsp;to&nbsp;learn&nbsp;technical&nbsp;skills&nbsp;like&nbsp;Python,&nbsp;Excel,&nbsp;or&nbsp;graphics&nbsp;visualization&nbsp;tools,&nbsp;without&nbsp;being&nbsp;hesitant.&nbsp;Besides&nbsp;this,&nbsp;allocate&nbsp;some&nbsp;minutes&nbsp;for&nbsp;daily&nbsp;practice.</li><li>That&#39;s&nbsp;it!&nbsp;You&nbsp;don&#39;t&nbsp;need&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;a&nbsp;brainiac&nbsp;or&nbsp;a&nbsp;coding&nbsp;whiz&nbsp;to&nbsp;get&nbsp;into&nbsp;the&nbsp;tech&nbsp;world!</li></ul><h2><strong>Step-by-Step:&nbsp;How&nbsp;to&nbsp;Start&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;After&nbsp;12th&nbsp;Commerce</strong></h2><p>Okay,&nbsp;let&nbsp;us&nbsp;take&nbsp;it&nbsp;step&nbsp;by&nbsp;step.&nbsp;I&nbsp;will&nbsp;make&nbsp;it&nbsp;straightforward&nbsp;and&nbsp;genuine—without&nbsp;complicated&nbsp;terminology,&nbsp;just&nbsp;what&nbsp;you&nbsp;really&nbsp;have&nbsp;to&nbsp;accomplish.</p><h4><strong>Step&nbsp;1:&nbsp;Build&nbsp;Your&nbsp;Basics</strong></h4><p>Start&nbsp;by&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;what&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;really&nbsp;does.&nbsp;Watch&nbsp;YouTube&nbsp;videos,&nbsp;follow&nbsp;simple&nbsp;blogs,&nbsp;and&nbsp;read&nbsp;beginner-friendly&nbsp;articles.</p><p>&nbsp;You&nbsp;can&nbsp;start&nbsp;learning&nbsp;basic&nbsp;tools&nbsp;like:</p><ul><li><strong>Microsoft&nbsp;Excel</strong>&nbsp;(for&nbsp;data&nbsp;handling)</li><li><strong>Google&nbsp;Sheets</strong>&nbsp;(to&nbsp;analyze&nbsp;data&nbsp;online)</li><li><strong>Power&nbsp;BI&nbsp;or&nbsp;Tableau</strong>&nbsp;(for&nbsp;data&nbsp;visualization)</li></ul><h4><strong>Step&nbsp;2:&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;the&nbsp;Key&nbsp;Skills</strong></h4><p>Once&nbsp;you’re&nbsp;comfortable&nbsp;with&nbsp;basic&nbsp;tools,&nbsp;move&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;main&nbsp;skills&nbsp;used&nbsp;in&nbsp;data&nbsp;science.&nbsp;Don’t&nbsp;worry,&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;learn&nbsp;these&nbsp;one&nbsp;by&nbsp;one&nbsp;online.</p><p>Here’s&nbsp;a&nbsp;list:</p><p><strong>Python&nbsp;Programming:&nbsp;</strong>It&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;most&nbsp;straightforward&nbsp;language&nbsp;for&nbsp;beginners&nbsp;and&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;most&nbsp;popular&nbsp;one&nbsp;in&nbsp;data&nbsp;science.</p><p><strong>Statistics:</strong>&nbsp;It&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;great&nbsp;support&nbsp;for&nbsp;data&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;by&nbsp;showing&nbsp;the&nbsp;patterns&nbsp;and&nbsp;trends.</p><p><strong>SQL:&nbsp;</strong>A&nbsp;must&nbsp;for&nbsp;database&nbsp;and&nbsp;large&nbsp;data&nbsp;set&nbsp;administration.</p><p><strong>Data&nbsp;Visualization:</strong>&nbsp;To&nbsp;create&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;charts&nbsp;and&nbsp;graphs&nbsp;from&nbsp;dull&nbsp;and&nbsp;monotonous&nbsp;figures.</p><h4><strong>Step&nbsp;3:&nbsp;Go&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;Diploma&nbsp;or&nbsp;Certificate&nbsp;Course</strong></h4><p>If&nbsp;you&nbsp;want&nbsp;proper&nbsp;guidance,&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;join&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong><u><a href="https://www.nidads.com/course/diploma-in-data-science-and-ai" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Diploma&nbsp;in&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th</a></u></strong>.&nbsp;And&nbsp;must&nbsp;buy&nbsp;a&nbsp;course&nbsp;from&nbsp;a&nbsp;recognized&nbsp;institute&nbsp;that&nbsp;doesn’t&nbsp;deliver&nbsp;only&nbsp;a&nbsp;basic&nbsp;curriculum&nbsp;but&nbsp;also&nbsp;equips&nbsp;its&nbsp;students&nbsp;with&nbsp;hands-on&nbsp;experience&nbsp;through&nbsp;various&nbsp;projects&nbsp;like&nbsp;NIDADS&nbsp;does.&nbsp;&nbsp;These&nbsp;are&nbsp;short-term&nbsp;courses&nbsp;(6&nbsp;months&nbsp;to&nbsp;1&nbsp;year)&nbsp;where&nbsp;you&nbsp;will&nbsp;learn&nbsp;everything&nbsp;from&nbsp;scratch.</p><p>Some&nbsp;popular&nbsp;options&nbsp;include:</p><ul><li><strong>Diploma&nbsp;in&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science</strong>&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Certificate&nbsp;in&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics</strong></li><li><strong>Professional&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;Courses</strong></li></ul><p>These&nbsp;courses&nbsp;are&nbsp;great&nbsp;for&nbsp;building&nbsp;your&nbsp;resume&nbsp;and&nbsp;getting&nbsp;real&nbsp;project&nbsp;experience.</p><h4><strong>Step&nbsp;4:&nbsp;Practice,&nbsp;Practice,&nbsp;Practice</strong></h4><p>This&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;step&nbsp;of&nbsp;highest&nbsp;importance.&nbsp;Don&#39;t&nbsp;only&nbsp;learn&nbsp;but&nbsp;also&nbsp;practice&nbsp;the&nbsp;learning.</p><ul><li>Get&nbsp;datasets&nbsp;from&nbsp;places&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;<strong><u><a href="https://www.kaggle.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Kaggle</a></u></strong>&nbsp;or&nbsp;Data.gov&nbsp;for&nbsp;your&nbsp;practice&nbsp;and&nbsp;analyze&nbsp;them.&nbsp;Work&nbsp;with&nbsp;Excel,&nbsp;create&nbsp;your&nbsp;own&nbsp;graphs,&nbsp;and&nbsp;compete&nbsp;with&nbsp;yourself&nbsp;to&nbsp;discover&nbsp;something&nbsp;interesting&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;data&nbsp;you&nbsp;have&nbsp;picked&nbsp;at&nbsp;random.</li><li>You&nbsp;will&nbsp;become&nbsp;a&nbsp;skilled&nbsp;person&nbsp;the&nbsp;more&nbsp;you&nbsp;practice.&nbsp;Do&nbsp;not&nbsp;forget,&nbsp;every&nbsp;great&nbsp;data&nbsp;scientist&nbsp;was&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;bottom&nbsp;—&nbsp;just&nbsp;like&nbsp;you.&nbsp;</li></ul><h4><strong>Step&nbsp;5:&nbsp;Build&nbsp;a&nbsp;Simple&nbsp;Portfolio</strong></h4><p>Once&nbsp;you&nbsp;start&nbsp;doing&nbsp;small&nbsp;projects,&nbsp;create&nbsp;a&nbsp;portfolio.</p><p><strong>You&nbsp;can:</strong></p><ul><li>Make&nbsp;a&nbsp;free&nbsp;GitHub&nbsp;account&nbsp;and&nbsp;upload&nbsp;your&nbsp;projects.</li><li>Write&nbsp;short&nbsp;posts&nbsp;on&nbsp;LinkedIn&nbsp;about&nbsp;what&nbsp;you’ve&nbsp;learned.</li><li>Present&nbsp;your&nbsp;Power&nbsp;BI&nbsp;or&nbsp;Tableau&nbsp;dashboards.</li></ul><p>It&nbsp;will&nbsp;demonstrate&nbsp;to&nbsp;others&nbsp;(and&nbsp;to&nbsp;your&nbsp;future&nbsp;employers)&nbsp;that&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;not&nbsp;only&nbsp;serious&nbsp;about&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;but&nbsp;also&nbsp;possess&nbsp;practical&nbsp;skills.</p><h4><strong>Step&nbsp;6:&nbsp;Go&nbsp;for&nbsp;Internships&nbsp;or&nbsp;Freelance&nbsp;Work</strong></h4><ul><li>Gradually&nbsp;apply&nbsp;for&nbsp;small&nbsp;internships&nbsp;or&nbsp;online&nbsp;gigs&nbsp;after&nbsp;skill&nbsp;development.&nbsp;They&nbsp;will&nbsp;help&nbsp;you&nbsp;gain&nbsp;experience&nbsp;and&nbsp;confidence,&nbsp;even&nbsp;if&nbsp;they&nbsp;are&nbsp;unpaid&nbsp;at&nbsp;first.</li><li>Websites&nbsp;like&nbsp;<strong>Internshala</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Fiverr</strong>,&nbsp;or&nbsp;<strong>Upwork</strong>&nbsp;have&nbsp;beginner-level&nbsp;data-related&nbsp;work.&nbsp;It’s&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;way&nbsp;to&nbsp;understand&nbsp;real-world&nbsp;problems&nbsp;and&nbsp;apply&nbsp;what&nbsp;you&nbsp;learned.</li></ul><h2><strong>What&nbsp;Is&nbsp;the&nbsp;Salary&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Scientist&nbsp;After&nbsp;12th?</strong></h2><ul><li>Now&nbsp;comes&nbsp;the&nbsp;question&nbsp;everyone&nbsp;wants&nbsp;to&nbsp;know&nbsp;—&nbsp;<em>“What&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;salary&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;data&nbsp;scientist&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th?”</em></li><li>Well,&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;start&nbsp;directly&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;with&nbsp;some&nbsp;diploma&nbsp;or&nbsp;certificate&nbsp;courses,&nbsp;your&nbsp;first&nbsp;job&nbsp;might&nbsp;pay&nbsp;around&nbsp;<strong>₹3–5&nbsp;lakhs&nbsp;per&nbsp;year</strong>.&nbsp;But&nbsp;as&nbsp;you&nbsp;gain&nbsp;experience,&nbsp;your&nbsp;salary&nbsp;can&nbsp;easily&nbsp;reach&nbsp;<strong>₹10–20&nbsp;lakhs&nbsp;per&nbsp;year</strong>&nbsp;or&nbsp;even&nbsp;higher,&nbsp;depending&nbsp;on&nbsp;your&nbsp;skills&nbsp;and&nbsp;company.</li><li>The&nbsp;best&nbsp;part?&nbsp;You&nbsp;don’t&nbsp;need&nbsp;a&nbsp;PhD&nbsp;or&nbsp;a&nbsp;fancy&nbsp;degree&nbsp;—&nbsp;your&nbsp;skills&nbsp;speak&nbsp;louder&nbsp;than&nbsp;your&nbsp;marks&nbsp;here.</li></ul><h3><strong>Career&nbsp;Options&nbsp;After&nbsp;Learning&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science</strong></h3><p>Once&nbsp;you&nbsp;learn&nbsp;data&nbsp;science,&nbsp;a&nbsp;whole&nbsp;bunch&nbsp;of&nbsp;doors&nbsp;open&nbsp;for&nbsp;you.&nbsp;You&nbsp;can&nbsp;work&nbsp;as&nbsp;a:</p><ul><li>Data&nbsp;Analyst</li><li>Business&nbsp;Analyst</li><li>Machine&nbsp;Learning&nbsp;Assistant</li><li>Data&nbsp;Visualization&nbsp;Expert</li><li>Junior&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Scientist</li></ul><h2><strong>Why&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;Is&nbsp;a&nbsp;Great&nbsp;Choice&nbsp;for&nbsp;Commerce&nbsp;Students</strong></h2><ul><li>Commerce&nbsp;students&nbsp;already&nbsp;know&nbsp;how&nbsp;to&nbsp;deal&nbsp;with&nbsp;numbers,&nbsp;trends,&nbsp;and&nbsp;business&nbsp;—&nbsp;which&nbsp;makes&nbsp;them&nbsp;naturally&nbsp;good&nbsp;at&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;data.</li><li>Data&nbsp;science&nbsp;combines&nbsp;both&nbsp;—&nbsp;<strong>business&nbsp;logic&nbsp;+&nbsp;number&nbsp;analysis</strong>.&nbsp;<a href="https://study.iitm.ac.in/mg/index.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">IIT&nbsp;Madras&nbsp;BS&nbsp;in&nbsp;Management&nbsp;and&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;So,&nbsp;you&nbsp;already&nbsp;have&nbsp;an&nbsp;advantage!</li></ul><h2><strong>Final&nbsp;Words:&nbsp;Start&nbsp;Small,&nbsp;Dream&nbsp;Big</strong></h2><p>If&nbsp;you’ve&nbsp;read&nbsp;this&nbsp;far,&nbsp;you&nbsp;already&nbsp;know&nbsp;—&nbsp;you&nbsp;don’t&nbsp;need&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;from&nbsp;a&nbsp;science&nbsp;stream&nbsp;to&nbsp;become&nbsp;a&nbsp;data&nbsp;scientist.&nbsp;You&nbsp;just&nbsp;need&nbsp;to&nbsp;start&nbsp;small&nbsp;and&nbsp;keep&nbsp;learning.&nbsp;Take&nbsp;one&nbsp;course.&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;one&nbsp;tool.&nbsp;Do&nbsp;one&nbsp;small&nbsp;project.&nbsp;That’s&nbsp;how&nbsp;every&nbsp;expert&nbsp;begins.</p><p>And&nbsp;who&nbsp;knows?&nbsp;A&nbsp;few&nbsp;years&nbsp;from&nbsp;now,&nbsp;someone&nbsp;might&nbsp;read&nbsp;your&nbsp;success&nbsp;story&nbsp;and&nbsp;ask,&nbsp;<em>“</em>Can&nbsp;a&nbsp;commerce&nbsp;student&nbsp;really&nbsp;do&nbsp;data&nbsp;science<em>?”</em></p><h2>About&nbsp;the&nbsp;Author</h2><p>Quick&nbsp;facts</p><p><strong>Name:</strong>&nbsp;Shagun</p><p><strong>From:</strong>&nbsp;Delhi</p><p><strong>Education:</strong>&nbsp;B.Tech</p><p><strong>Program:</strong>&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;and&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics</p><p><strong>Placed&nbsp;in:</strong>&nbsp;NIDADS&nbsp;(National&nbsp;Institute&nbsp;of&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science)</p><p><strong>Covers&nbsp;topics:</strong>&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science,&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics,&nbsp;Artificial&nbsp;Intelligence,&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning,&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Engineering,&nbsp;Deep&nbsp;Learning</p><p><strong>Currently&nbsp;working&nbsp;as:&nbsp;</strong>Senior&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;Trainer</p><p><strong>In&nbsp;her&nbsp;words</strong>:&nbsp;&quot;The&nbsp;best&nbsp;way&nbsp;to&nbsp;learn&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;isn&#39;t&nbsp;just&nbsp;solving&nbsp;problems&nbsp;—&nbsp;it&#39;s&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;why&nbsp;the&nbsp;solution&nbsp;works.&nbsp;That&#39;s&nbsp;what&nbsp;I&nbsp;try&nbsp;to&nbsp;teach&nbsp;every&nbsp;single&nbsp;day.&quot;</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  
</body>
